ny what  you're you're talking about with  steven's score  i can never watch this scene here  without choking up uh  but it's the emotion of that score as  the white bird flies over fifa's head  and  then this this beautiful melody  [Music]  and steven recorded that i think was on  christmas night  he said by himself he just played the  guitar  and he had a glass of wine and he  whistled and that  simple little melody here is just  growing swelling swelling and  it's oh yeah it was at three o'clock in  the morning i remember them recording  this and  imagining this day i mean even just  talking about it now  it really really is special i think the  fact that the entire crew was  living through this global pandemic of  uncertainty  we woke in mourning certain that we were  gonna  lean into making this film i think each  one of us  knew that this film was so special and  that  you know it wasn't just about getting  across the finish line it was about  let's let's honor this film and and make  it the best that we can
 

